---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="EmbeddedLab · LED 控制系统" currentPath="/projects">
  <slot name="head">
    <style>
      .page { padding: 2.5rem 0; }
      .page-head { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
      .page-head h1 { margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
      .page-head .meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; margin-top: 0.75rem; }

      /* STAR cards with colored tops */
      .star-grid { display: grid; gap: 1rem; }
      .star-card {
        background: var(--bg-card);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        overflow: hidden;
        transition: box-shadow 0.2s;
      }
      .star-card:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); }
      .star-card .bar { height: 3px; }
      .star-card .body { padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem; }
      .star-card .label {
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      }
      .star-card p { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.7; }
      .star-card code { font-size: 0.82em; }

      .bar-s { background: #16a34a; }
      .bar-t { background: #ea580c; }
      .bar-a { background: #2563eb; }
      .bar-r { background: #dc2626; }
      .label-s { color: #16a34a; }
      .label-t { color: #ea580c; }
      .label-a { color: #2563eb; }
      .label-r { color: #dc2626; }

      .arch-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
      .arch-card {
        border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        overflow: hidden;
        transition: box-shadow 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
      }
      .arch-card:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); transform: translateY(-2px); }
      .arch-card h3 {
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        background: var(--bg-muted);
        padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
        margin: 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
      }
      .arch-card p {
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        padding: 0.75rem;
        margin: 0;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .spec-grid { display: grid; gap: 0.75rem; }
      .spec-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: baseline;
        gap: 1rem;
        padding: 0.6rem 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
      }
      .spec-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
      .spec-row .label {
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        min-width: 80px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }
      .spec-row .value {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .principle-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 0.6rem; }
      .principle-list li {
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
        background: var(--bg-card);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
        border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
        border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
      }

      .page-foot {
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        padding-top: 2rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
        margin-top: 2rem;
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      }

      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .arch-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      }
    </style>
  </slot>

  <div class="page fade-in">
    <div class="content-container">

      <div class="page-head">
        <h1>串口命令控制 LED 系统</h1>
        <div class="meta">
          <span class="tag">STM32F407</span>
          <span class="tag">C</span>
          <span class="tag">Keil MDK</span>
          <span class="tag">标准外设库</span>
          <span class="tag">UART</span>
          <span class="tag">SysTick</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- STAR -->
      <div class="page-section">
        <h2>📋 项目概述</h2>
        <div class="star-grid">
          <div class="star-card">
            <div class="bar bar-s"></div>
            <div class="body">
              <div class="label label-s">S · 情境</div>
              <p>传统单片机教学多采用阻塞式延时（<code>delay_ms</code>），CPU 被空循环占用。初版仅支持按键切换 LED，架构不可扩展。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="star-card">
            <div class="bar bar-t"></div>
            <div class="body">
              <div class="label label-t">T · 任务</div>
              <p>设计<strong>非阻塞 LED 控制系统</strong>，支持串口命令实时控制，建立可复用的驱动模块架构。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="star-card">
            <div class="bar bar-a"></div>
            <div class="body">
              <div class="label label-a">A · 行动</div>
              <p>
                分层架构（BSP/App/User）实现模块解耦；UART 中断 + 环形缓冲区 FIFO 零丢数据；
                SysTick 1ms 中断提供非阻塞延时；命令解析引擎支持 8+ 颜色控制。
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="star-card">
            <div class="bar bar-r"></div>
            <div class="body">
              <div class="label label-r">R · 结果</div>
              <p>
                <strong>零阻塞</strong>验证通过，串口命令秒回；模块化架构可直接复用；全程配套开发指南与文档沉淀。
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Architecture -->
      <div class="page-section">
        <h2>🏗️ 架构设计</h2>
        <div class="arch-grid">
          <div class="arch-card">
            <h3>User</h3>
            <p>顶层胶合逻辑，初始化各模块、主循环任务调度、命令路由</p>
          </div>
          <div class="arch-card">
            <h3>App</h3>
            <p>应用逻辑层，命令解析引擎、LED 模式管理、状态机调度</p>
          </div>
          <div class="arch-card">
            <h3>BSP</h3>
            <p>硬件抽象层，bsp_led / bsp_usart / bsp_systick / bsp_fifo，封装寄存器操作</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tech Specs -->
      <div class="page-section">
        <h2>⚙️ 技术要点</h2>
        <div class="spec-grid">
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="label">中断接收</span>
            <span class="value">UART RXNE 中断 + 环形缓冲区，ISR 只存不处理，零丢数据</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="label">非阻塞延时</span>
            <span class="value">SysTick 1ms 中断，提供 Tick_Get / Tick_Elapsed API</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="label">命令解析</span>
            <span class="value">strncmp + sscanf 引擎，支持 8+ 颜色指令及 help/status</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="label">模块封装</span>
            <span class="value">各外设独立 .c/.h，接口明确、隐藏实现</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Principles -->
      <div class="page-section">
        <h2>🧭 设计原则</h2>
        <ul class="principle-list">
          <li>不是临时应付，是长期积累</li>
          <li>不是「学生作业」思维，是「企业工程师」标准</li>
          <li>每个模块配套文档 + 日志 + 科普，确保可追溯可复用</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="page-foot">
        EmbeddedLab · 个人嵌入式工程实验室
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
